00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:42,000
Little Boy is a comedy, drama, war film directed by Alejandro Monteverde.

3
00:15:54,000 --> 00:16:00,000
An eight-year-old boy is willing to do whatever it takes to end
World War II so he can bring his father home.

4
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:18,000
The story reveals the indescribable love a father has for his
little boy and the love a son has for his father.

5
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:36,000
Pepper Flynt Busbee / Little Boy, played by Jakob Salvati.

